
Minfrit v1 is a utility that helps to find club  .
Features

    The user can search for clubs by age, category and location
    The user can register in the clubs of their interest
    The user can leave the previously registered club
    
    
    Secure admin
    The administrator manages the clubs
    The administrator manages the categories
    The administrator manages users and their records
    
    
    

Architecture

Php 7.4
Mysql 15.1
HTML 5.0


Methodology

OPC Determines the menu option to be used
MOD Determine editing and viewing options
CN Determine the sections to replace
FN Determine connections to the database
JS Determine the events the user needs

